    "physicalDescription": "Psychadelic poster in green, deep pink, orange, and yellow, with a white outer border, black background split into symmetrical shaped segments with pink, green, yellow line borders. Two triangular panels bottom corners contain stylized floral decoration, and one shaped panel at the top features the title and text. The main image is circular and features a female face with green eyes and black outlines, pink cheeks, wild flowing red hair with pink flowers against a bright pale green background.",
